    id: 'appearance',
    title: 'Changing how Aman looks',
    covers: [],
    body: '## Switch between light and dark quickly\n\nClick **More** at the bottom of the left bar. Under **Appearance**, click **Light**, **Dark** or **Match my computer**. A check shows the one you use now.\n\n## Choose a colour theme\n\n1. Click **More** in the left bar, then click **Settings**.\n2. Click **Themes**. The page is called **Appearance**.\n3. Under Color mode, click **Light**, **Dark** or **System**. **System** follows your computer.\n4. Under Theme, click **Paper**, **Forest**, **Midnight** or **High contrast**.\n\n**High contrast** gives the clearest text. Your choice stays until you change it.',
